        "comment": "Opening enemy at t=0 is schedule index 0; firstSpawnSeconds is the first additional spawn, so spawns land at 0, 10, 20 and 30 seconds. ringRadiusFraction 0.84375 is exactly 16.2/19.2, the approved spawn distance.",
